WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.380
Deep in the crystal mine, the team was having a peaceful night for the first time.

2
00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:09.150
The three who had woken were sleeping under silver blankets.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:13.900
Warning! A secret signal was sent from inside the mine.

4
00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.710
A signal? There's no one here but us.

5
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:21.980
Then whoever sent the signal… is one of us.

6
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:27.580
Everyone looked at each other. The silence was heavier than the hum of the crystals.

7
00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:30.860
Who could it be? We all ran away from Sila!

8
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:34.480
Pusula, where exactly did the signal come from?

9
00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:38.070
From the west tunnel. Last night, at three o'clock.

10
00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:42.580
That night, only one person was on watch in the west tunnel. Eray.

11
00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:46.470
What? Me? I was just talking to the creatures!

12
00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:50.330
To the creatures? At midnight, all alone?

13
00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.970
For the first time, the crystals on Eray's shoulders were blinking red.

14
00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:58.540
Eray, look me in the eye. Tell us the truth.

15
00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:03.840
I am telling the truth! The crystals call me, so I go. That's all!

16
00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:07.600
Could the crystals' voice be reaching Sila too?

17
00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:11.240
All the crystals on these islands are linked to the same network.

18
00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:15.260
A child could leak a signal without even realizing it.

19
00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:21.050
Eray's eyes filled with tears. For the first time, his friends were looking at him with suspicion.

20
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.140
You don't believe me. None of you.

21
00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:27.610
Eray, wait! Nobody's blaming you!

22
00:01:28.010 --> 00:01:30.730
But Eray had already run into the dark tunnel.

23
00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:34.090
Sergeant dashed after him without a second thought.

24
00:01:34.390 --> 00:01:36.230
Sergeant! Come back!

25
00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:41.540
At the same time, in the fortress tower, Sila was listening to a red hologram.

26
00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:46.160
So they're in the mine. And the little keeper ran away. Perfect.

27
00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:50.400
Guards! Surround the west tunnel. I want the boy alive.

28
00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:54.430
At the end of the tunnel, Eray came out into a giant crystal cave.

29
00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:57.230
Glowing creatures gathered around him.

30
00:01:57.530 --> 00:02:00.890
You understand me, don't you? Why don't they?

31
00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:03.710
But suddenly the creatures' light went out.

32
00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:07.400
Red-eyed robots appeared at the cave entrance.

33
00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.300
Eray! Behind you!

34
00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:13.600
Sergeant darted between the robots and distracted them.

35
00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:18.530
Eray jumped into a deep crevasse with the creatures and vanished.

36
00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:21.280
Eray! Eray, answer me!

37
00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:23.960
Mira's ice stopped the robots.

38
00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:28.990
But all that was left of Eray was a small blue crystal shard.

39
00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.600
We'll find him. I promise.

40
00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:33.750
Eray's heartbeat is strong.

41
00:02:33.800 --> 00:02:38.000
And… I think he's singing with the creatures right now.

42
00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:42.140
Back at camp, Kael examined the robots' tracks.

43
00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:47.390
These robots weren't after Eray. They were heading straight for our camp.

44
00:02:47.820 --> 00:02:52.460
Then Eray didn't send the signal. The traitor is still among us.

45
00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:56.300
A new signal! It's being sent right now. From this camp!

46
00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:58.080
Everyone froze.

47
00:02:58.130 --> 00:03:04.570
And in the shadow of the campfire, a hand silently switched off a red signal device.

